# kOA-Linux review ownership.
#
# This maintained projection mirrors the active rules in .koa/path-ownership.json.
# GitHub team slugs mirror canonical owner_id values with underscores changed to hyphens.
# Repository administrators must provision each visible team with write access before
# enforcing required code-owner review.

